                                                "sense_id": "81e4a54f-9107-385d-bd5a-7955bdca571c",
                                                "text": "Division of occupational safety and health policy and procedures manual, 30 June 1994: “FTA (Failure to Abate). An additional penalty was assessed for the employer's failure to abate a previous violation.”"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "387fba09-17d7-4fb1-b853-22e89f68f541",
                                                "sense_id": "81e4a54f-9107-385d-bd5a-7955bdca571c",
                                                "text": "The types of violations cited are serious general, non-serious general, willful, repeat, and failure to abate (FTA) violations."
                                            }
